      "message": "these concern are not a problem: the file is expected to be exactly 512K in size (checked in get_file_or_die(), and here we are could be decrementing the size to get rid of the padding, if any.\n\nIf there is no padding, the data_len would be 512K, so the operation in line 727 is a noop. If there is padding then we\u0027d transfer a few extra 0xFF bytes in the end of the image, but the image is written into the erased flash page, so 0xFF is the contents there already.",
